                <pb facs="0837" n="797" xml:id="pg797"/>

                <head>345. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>British Prime Minister Anthony Eden and Foreign Minister Selwyn Lloyd visited
                    Washington January 30–February 1 for talks with President Eisenhower, Secretary
                    Dulles, and other U.S. officials. Regarding the Eden talks, including material
                    relating to Iran, see <ref target="#d94">Documents 94</ref> ff.</p>
            </div>
